OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader stands down after
OL,4,Afour months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader is stepping down from
OL,7,Fthe role less than four months after
OL,8,Ftaking up the position.
OL,10,FReform UK's Graham Harrison was
OL,11,Fselected as Hartlepool Borough
OL,12,FCouncil's leader in May, after the
OL,13,Fparty secured more seats than anyone
OL,14,Felse in the local election.
OL,16,FIn a statement on Monday, he said he
OL,17,Fhad made the "very difficult decision"
OL,18,Fto stand down as a recent change in his
OL,19,Fpersonal circumstances meant he was "no
OL,20,Flonger able" to commit the required
OL,21,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
