OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader stands down after
OL,4,Afour months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new leader will be appointed at an
OL,7,Fextraordinary meeting of the council on
OL,8,F15 September, with Harrison set to
OL,9,Fcontinue representing the Burn Valley
OL,10,Fward as a councillor.
